{
  "dn20:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 20 ",
  "dn20:0.2": "Mahāsamayasutta ",
  "dn20:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn20:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi; ",
  "dn20:1.3": "dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca. ",
  "dn20:2.1": "Atha kho catunnaṁ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṁ devatānaṁ etadahosi: ",
  "dn20:2.2": "“ayaṁ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi; ",
  "dn20:2.3": "dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca. ",
  "dn20:2.4": "Yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṁ gāthaṁ bhāseyyāmā”ti. ",
  "dn20:3.1": "Atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṁ. ",
  "dn20:3.2": "Atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu. ",
  "dn20:3.3": "Ekamantaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
  "dn20:3.4": "“Mahāsamayo pavanasmiṁ, ",
  "dn20:3.5": "Devakāyā samāgatā; ",
  "dn20:3.6": "Āgatamha imaṁ dhammasamayaṁ, ",
  "dn20:3.7": "Dakkhitāye 